  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Start from the right side.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 1600,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 48,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "We look for the first index i, where nams at i is smaller than nams at i plus 1.",
      "start_ms": 1920,
      "end_ms": 9020,
      "start_frame": 58,
      "end_frame": 271,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Why?",
      "start_ms": 9380,
      "end_ms": 9940,
      "start_frame": 281,
      "end_frame": 298,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Because everything to the right of that position forms a non -increasing suffix.",
      "start_ms": 10280,
      "end_ms": 16240,
      "start_frame": 308,
      "end_frame": 487,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "That suffix is already the largest possible arrangement of those suffix values.",
      "start_ms": 16620,
      "end_ms": 22880,
      "start_frame": 499,
      "end_frame": 686,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "So changing only that suffix cannot give us a larger permutation.",
      "start_ms": 22880,
      "end_ms": 29160,
      "start_frame": 686,
      "end_frame": 875,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "The first place where we can increase the permutation is the pivot.",
      "start_ms": 30180,
      "end_ms": 34520,
      "start_frame": 905,
      "end_frame": 1036,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Now we have to increase that pivot, but only by the smallest possible amount.",
      "start_ms": 35200,
      "end_ms": 40420,
      "start_frame": 1056,
      "end_frame": 1213,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "So we search from the right again for the first value, that is strictly greater than the pivot.",
      "start_ms": 41320,
      "end_ms": 49060,
      "start_frame": 1240,
      "end_frame": 1472,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "Because the suffix is non -increasing, the first greater value from the right is the smallest value that can increase the pivot.",
      "start_ms": 49700,
      "end_ms": 58740,
      "start_frame": 1491,
      "end_frame": 1762,
      "word_count": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "We swap those two values.",
      "start_ms": 59500,
      "end_ms": 61500,
      "start_frame": 1785,
      "end_frame": 1845,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Now the permutation is larger.",
      "start_ms": 61960,
      "end_ms": 64080,
      "start_frame": 1859,
      "end_frame": 1922,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "And after this swap, the suffix is still non -increasing.",
      "start_ms": 64580,
      "end_ms": 69160,
      "start_frame": 1937,
      "end_frame": 2075,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "But we still need the very next permutation.",
      "start_ms": 69520,
      "end_ms": 72680,
      "start_frame": 2086,
      "end_frame": 2180,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "So everything after the pivot must become as small as possible.",
      "start_ms": 73480,
      "end_ms": 78020,
      "start_frame": 2204,
      "end_frame": 2341,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Because the suffix is non -increasing, reversing it gives us the smallest possible suffix.",
      "start_ms": 78020,
      "end_ms": 85760,
      "start_frame": 2341,
      "end_frame": 2573,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "So we do not need to sort it.",
      "start_ms": 86360,
      "end_ms": 88480,
      "start_frame": 2591,
      "end_frame": 2654,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "We simply reverse it.",
      "start_ms": 88880,
      "end_ms": 90660,
      "start_frame": 2666,
      "end_frame": 2720,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "So the optimal reasoning is, find the rightmost place that can increase, make the smallest possible increase there, then minimize everything after it.",
      "start_ms": 91380,
      "end_ms": 104260,
      "start_frame": 2741,
      "end_frame": 3128,
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "text": "Now let's execute that on our master example.",
      "start_ms": 104260,
      "end_ms": 108400,
      "start_frame": 3128,
      "end_frame": 3252,
      "word_count": 8
    }
  ],
